        "original_id": "3dec1ca2-fff0-559f-9887-82f32bc38fe4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Petit Basset Griffon Vendéen, Toy Trawler Spaniel\n- Concepts: dog breeds, scent hounds, Spaniels, extinction\n- Places: Vendée district, France\n\nFacts:\n- The Petit Basset Griffon Vendéen, or PBGV, is a breed of dog of the scent hound type.\n- The Petit Basset Griffon Vendéen was bred to trail hares in the bramble-filled terrain of the Vendée district of France.\n- The Toy Trawler Spaniel is an extinct breed of Spaniel.\n- The Toy Trawler Spaniel physically resembled the King Charles Spaniel of the 16th century.",
